  <front>
    <title>Internet Emergency Preparedness (IEPREP) Telephony Topology Terminology</title>
    <seriesInfo name="RFC" value="3523" stream="IETF"/>
    <date year="2003" month="April"/>
    <abstract pn="section-abstract">
      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-1">This document defines the topology naming conventions that are to be
used in reference to Internet Emergency Preparedness (IEPREP) phone
calls.  These naming conventions should be used to focus the IEPREP
Working Group during discussions and when writing requirements, gap
analysis and other solutions documents.</t>
    </abstract>
